## What was built

**File:** `VendorInvoiceProcessing/VendorInvoiceProcessing/VendorInvoiceProcessing.flow`

The flow has 6 nodes wired in sequence:

```
[New Invoice Received]  →  [Extract Invoice Fields*]  →  [Map Extracted Fields]
        (manual trigger)         (IxP mock placeholder)        (JS script)
                                                                     │ success
                                                               [Post Invoice to SAP]
                                                                     │ output          │ error
                                                                  [End]          [Terminate on Error]
```

The **Map Extracted Fields** node reads every field your IxP model extracts — Invoice Number, Vendor Name, Invoice Date, Total Amount, Line Items — and packages them into the BAPI payload shape. The **Post Invoice to SAP** node calls SAP via the `uipath-sap-bapi` Integration Service connector. Both error paths (script failure and SAP failure) route to a **Terminate** node.

---

